diff --git a/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7229.bugfix b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7229.bugfix
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..c1e55eb80
--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7229.bugfix
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Commas in a regular expression are no longer treated as separators in options taking a
+comma-separated list of regular expressions (e.g. ``bad-names-rgxs``), as long as they
+are part of a quantifier (``{1,3}``), a character class (``[,;]``) or escaped (``\,``).
+
+Closes #7229
